#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:35 18849719e2a048e7ac422f1c4d606d4a
msgid ""
"The lidar should be mounted horizontally on the top or bottom of the vehicle"
" with the arrow on top of the unit pointing towards the front of the "
"vehicle. Ensure the sensor's view is not obstructed by any portion of the "
"vehicle including GPS mast, vehicle legs etc."
msgstr ""
"激光雷达应水平安装在飞行器顶部或底部，设备顶部的箭头朝向飞行器前方。确保传感器视野不被飞行器任何部分遮挡，包括 GPS 桅杆、飞行器支腿等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:38 c15b256a4e3b4964ad25e4a2854f2954
msgid ""
"The lidar can be connected to the autopilot's serial input as shown above. "
"If using a Pixhawk/Pixhawk2 Telem1 (aka Serial1) should be used because it "
"is more capable of providing the required power."
msgstr ""
"激光雷达可如上图所示连接到飞控的串口输入。如果使用 Pixhawk/Pixhawk2，应使用 Telem1（即 Serial1），因为其供电能力更强。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:41 23d341ae1d294a96a9d86c3f9588dd0f
msgid ""
"only the Lidar's TX pin is used. Its pwm motor control input pin is not "
"connected and the lidar will spin at a default rate (reported in its "
"telemetry back to the autopilot)."
msgstr "仅使用激光雷达的 TX 引脚，其 PWM 电机控制输入引脚不连接，激光雷达将以默认速率旋转（通过遥测反馈给飞控）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:43 be5c731e7c7e4bc78e15ea83e6ab6b1f
msgid "Example setup below shown for first proximity sensor:"
msgstr "以下为第一个近距传感器的设置示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:45 c54117dbdef84c33a9eeb9b83186eaa8
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = \"11\" (\"Lidar360\") if using "
"Serial1"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 「11」（「Lidar360」），如果使用 Serial1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:46 048866f459974b6bb95be6bcff2d20e1
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` =  \"230\" if using Serial1 as connection"
" port"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 「230」，如果使用 Serial1 作为连接端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:47 9a18b361d25442efb997d593cfc58dfe
msgid ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = \"16\""
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 「16」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:48 f5c235846e7a4765a500d5de88960f36
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = \"0\" if mounted on the top of the "
"vehicle, \"1\" if mounted upside-down on the bottom of the vehicle."
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = 「0」，如果安装在飞行器顶部；「1」，如果倒置安装在飞行器底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:50 7c222d49586d48139dc3c2e5c6912706
msgid ""
"It may be necessary to turn off flow control if using Telem1 (aka Serial1) "
"or Telem2 (aka Serial2)"
msgstr "如果使用 Telem1（即 Serial1）或 Telem2（即 Serial2），可能需要关闭流控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:52 45e1ed051b4a4ba7ae20a04c599ef43a
msgid ":ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` =  \"0\" if using Serial1"
msgstr ":ref:`BRD_SER1_RTSCTS <BRD_SER1_RTSCTS>` = 「0」，如果使用 Serial1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ld06.rst:54 07d35f45707a44e28e9d842093666a97
msgid ""
"More details on using this sensor for object avoidance on Copter can be "
"found :ref:`here <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"有关在 Copter 上使用此传感器进行避障的更多详情，请参阅 :ref:`此处 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`。"
